flowchart TD
 Manifest[Validate manifest] --> Temp[Create random temporary file]
 Temp --> Write[Write and hash chunks]
 Write --> Verify{Size and hash match?}
 Verify -->|Yes| File[Sync / close / unique rename]
 File --> DB[Record SQLite completion]
 DB --> Ack[Send complete acknowledgment]
 Write -->|Disconnect| Cleanup[Delete temporary file]
 Verify -->|No| Cleanup
 DB -->|Record fails| Remove[Remove renamed file and report error]
